  "profileTermsSection1Title": "Your account and responsibility",
  "profileTermsSection1Body": "Provide accurate details and update them when needed. Keep your sign-in details private and tell us if you notice unusual activity.",
  "profileTermsSection2Title": "Shipment protection",
  "profileTermsSection2Body": "Protection applies to shipments for which you selected Haseen protection at checkout with a partner store, according to the plan linked to your order.",
  "profileTermsSection3Title": "Orders and compensation",
  "profileTermsSection3Body": "You can submit a claim within the stated period after delivery. We review the evidence and share our decision. Approved compensation is sent using the original payment method.",
  "profileTermsSection4Title": "Acceptable use",
  "profileTermsSection4Body": "You may not use the app for unlawful activity, infringe ownership rights, or submit false details or evidence.",
  "profileTermsSection5Title": "Changes to these terms",
  "profileTermsSection5Body": "We may update these terms from time to time and will notify you before a material change affects you.",
  "profilePrivacySection1Title": "Data we collect",
  "profilePrivacySection1Body": "Your name, phone number, email, partner-store order details, claim evidence you upload, and your location if you allow access.",
  "profilePrivacySection2Title": "How we use it",
  "profilePrivacySection2Body": "We use it to activate shipment protection, track delivery, review claims, issue compensation, and improve your app experience.",
  "profilePrivacySection3Title": "Who we share it with",
  "profilePrivacySection3Body": "We share only what is needed with the store, carrier, and insurance partner to serve your request. We do not sell your data.",
  "profilePrivacySection4Title": "How we protect it",
  "profilePrivacySection4Body": "We store your data using encryption and limit which team members can access it.",
  "profilePrivacySection5Title": "Your rights and choices",
  "profilePrivacySection5Body": "You can view, update, or request deletion of your data. You can also turn off location sharing in settings at any time.",
  "profilePrivacySection6Title": "Contact us",
  "profilePrivacySection6Body": "For privacy questions, open a support ticket from your account.",
  "profileProtectionSection1Title": "Protection coverage",
  "profileProtectionSection1Body": "Protection covers shipment loss or damage during transit according to the plan selected for your order. See each shipment page for its specific coverage.",
  "profileProtectionSection2Title": "What is not covered",
  "profileProtectionSection2Body": "Misuse after delivery, manufacturing defects, and damage unrelated to transportation are not covered.",
  "profileProtectionSection3Title": "When to submit a claim",
  "profileProtectionSection3Body": "After delivery, submit within two days of receipt. For a missing shipment, you can submit after the estimated delivery date.",
  "profileProtectionSection4Title": "Required evidence",
  "profileProtectionSection4Body": "A photo of the package and tracking number, photos of the packaging and item, and a short video showing the damage.",
  "profileProtectionSection5Title": "Compensation",
  "profileProtectionSection5Body": "If your claim is approved, compensation is returned to the original payment method within 3–5 business days.",
